{"4907980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Call the Ambulance", "steam_appid": 4907980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/fa42686b1f873f22c8dd0373c01f635c.webp?t=1787246044\" width=616 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call the Ambulance is a chaotic co-op comedy for 1–4 players about being the world's least qualified emergency crew. Answer the call, storm the scene, and turn every rescue into glorious, physics-fueled disaster — part ambulance sim, part friendship-ending chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/27dc7d3bf323601109efb9016b507d50.poster.avif?t=1787246044\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/27dc7d3bf323601109efb9016b507d50.webm?t=1787246044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/27dc7d3bf323601109efb9016b507d50.mp4?t=1787246044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/85042d1fec5b8ccab1a1aa261db1f8a2.webp?t=1787246044\" width=616 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pile into the ambulance with up to three friends and split the chaos: one drives, one hauls the stretcher, one panics with the checklist. Every call is a team effort. Every mistake is a group project.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/845bdf6fa1084d50da81f6e775ad1ab3.poster.avif?t=1787246044\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/845bdf6fa1084d50da81f6e775ad1ab3.webm?t=1787246044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/845bdf6fa1084d50da81f6e775ad1ab3.mp4?t=1787246044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/9e1a941028593bcdc83d85ccaca84240.webp?t=1787246044\" width=616 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack open the med bag — scissors, stethoscope, gauze, a suspicious banana — follow the checklist, and treat patients in ways that would make a real medic faint. Enthusiasm over expertise, every time<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/681aa4291ca34586f183c66c0c13ad35.poster.avif?t=1787246044\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/681aa4291ca34586f183c66c0c13ad35.webm?t=1787246044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/681aa4291ca34586f183c66c0c13ad35.mp4?t=1787246044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/275a80cd90e41be8782dcaca8a19151e.webp?t=1787246044\" width=616 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tea-sipping patient with an axe in his skull. A body-shaped lump on a filthy couch. A bank job gone loud. Even, somehow, a pirate. From ordinary living rooms to full-blown catastrophes, no two emergencies are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/39a22a61fb9bc045f8f52ad4e23cc81c.webp?t=1787246044\" width=616 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to jump into, impossible to do with dignity. Bring friends. Bring bandages. Leave your reputation at the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call the Ambulance. Help is on the way. God help your patients.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/fa42686b1f873f22c8dd0373c01f635c.webp?t=1787246044\" width=616 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call the Ambulance is a chaotic co-op comedy for 1–4 players about being the world's least qualified emergency crew. Answer the call, storm the scene, and turn every rescue into glorious, physics-fueled disaster — part ambulance sim, part friendship-ending chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/27dc7d3bf323601109efb9016b507d50.poster.avif?t=1787246044\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/27dc7d3bf323601109efb9016b507d50.webm?t=1787246044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/27dc7d3bf323601109efb9016b507d50.mp4?t=1787246044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907980/extras/85042d1fec5b8ccab1a1aa261db1f8a2.webp?t=1787246044\" width=616 height=51 /></span></h2><p 